  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::SoldierTask
  title: Greet the tin soldier
  introLine: Last one! The tin soldier has started his night patrol. Look at him
    and give him a friendly wave.
  hint: 'Find the soldier marching on the floor, look at him and swipe your hand
    left or right to wave. Careful: if you push towards him, he''ll topple over!'
  howItWorks: His spring turns a little crank that rocks his legs forwards and backwards
    in turn, so he marches. The same rocking swings his arms, just like a real soldier.
