  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::TrainTask
  title: Fix the steam train
  introLine: First, the steam train! Its wheels, chimney, cowcatcher and key are
    in the tray. Fit them back on.
  hint: The loose parts are in the tray on the left of the workbench. Fit each one
    where it belongs on the train (a see-through outline shows the spot). When all
    five are on, circle your hand three times to wind the key.
  howItWorks: Winding the key tightens a coiled spring. As the spring unwinds it
    turns gears that drive the wheels, and the coupling rods link the wheels so they
    all turn together, while the pistons slide in and out.
  clockTime: 23.2
  beaconTarget: {fileID: 666946291}
  windsNeeded: 3
  windTarget: {fileID: 2111813072}
  windRange: 2
  repair: {fileID: 1222932097}
